    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'08'15PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 15.08.2025 1A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2449$64 \u2013 2025 wf.daia;= ui 15 jeks isl=rdod \u2013 2025'08'15No. 2449/64 \u2013 FRIDAY, AUGUST 15, 2025\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A \u2013 G 045143 \u2013 09 (08/2025)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nO\u0d8b\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b \u0d8e\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b S\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 38 (b)\n\nOrder No. 67 of 2025\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4/3/10/2020/MV/288-C. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: DSM/NUL/LND/7/23-III' BY virtue of the powers vested in me by the Order under Section 38 (b) of Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby declare by this order that the lands referred to in Column I of the Schedule are subjected to the servitude speci\ufb01 ed in the corresponding entry in Column II of that Schedule. K.D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMinistry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla,24th July, 2025.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nI. Description of the Land.\u2013 Allotments of land depicted in below names and extents in the Cadastral Map C.M.No. 310214, Block No. 02, Sheet No. 01 dated 07.11.2023 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village called Habaragahamada (Old Nalanda and Pilihudugolla) in No. E 410C, Habaragahamada Grama Niladhari Division in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Naula in Matale District of Central Province and bounded as follows.\n\nII. Description of Servitude.\u2013 Acquisition of servitude of the land for the construction of the Bowathenna Tunnel and contructions related to the North Western Province Canal Project."
  },
