    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2449/74 - 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u0ddd\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dc3 16 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dd9\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dc3\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.08.16\n\nNo. 2449/74 \u2013 SATURDAY, AUGUST 16, 2025 - 16.08.2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7 My Reference No. of the Divisional Secretary: KDS/KGK/4/9/2017/1/LA. Reference No. of the Ministry of Lands: 4-3/11/2016/UD/521. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose. Description of the land to be acquired:- The allotments of land depicted as Lot No. 3 in the Preliminary Plan No. Maha 1993 dated 29.05.2020 Prepared by Senior Superintendent of Surveys of Kandy on behalf of the Surveyor General, situated at the Bahirawakanda Division No. 18 - Katukele (within the Kandy Municipal Council Limit) in the Grama Niladhari's Division (225) Katukele in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Kandy Four Gravets and Gangawata Korale in the District of Kandy, Central Province and containing in extent 0.0023 Hectares."
