    "chunk_text": "01. Lot No. 1 Name of the Land: Assessment No. 1796, Maharagama Road; Description: Open Waste land; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: K. D. Lakshman Perera, No. 672/B5, Arawwala, Pannipitiya, (to finalize the land acquisition process) Extent: 0.0010 Hectare. 02. Lot No. 2 Name of the Land: Assessment No. Cannot be found, Maharagama Road; Description: Open Waste land; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: - (Needed to Widening the Piliyandala\u2014Maharagama Road) Extent: 0.0024 Hectare. 03. Lot No. 3 Name of the Land: Assessment No. 1689, Maharagama Road; Description: Open Waste land; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: A.A.J. Amarasinghe,\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS Land Acquisition Notices\n\n1A G 045161 - 12 (08/2025)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nNo. 584/3C, Arawwala, Pannipitiya, (to finalize the land Acquisition process) Extent: 0.0007 Hectare. All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Kesbewa on the 02nd day of October, 2025 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 01st October 2025 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands/\n\nservitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nIshanka D.K. Udawatta, Divisional Secretary & Land Acquiring Officer, Kesbewa.\n\nAt Divisional Secretariat, Kesbewa 07th August 2025.\n\nEOG 08-0194"
  },
