    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS Title Registration NOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO PROPERTY OF INTESTATE R\u0d7e\u0d80\u0d82\u0d8c\u0d8d\u0d8b\u0d7a\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 \u0d88\u0d7f T\u0d82\u0d8d\u0d85\u0d7e A\u0d7c\u0d8d, N\u0d88. 21 \u0d88\u0d7f 1998 (S\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 55) REFERENCE the intestate property of late Mr Atigala Widana Arachchilage Kasthurirathna resided in the village of Pitipana North , in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Homagama , in the District of Colombo. IT is hereby notified that any person/s who have a claim to or interest in the intestate property of the late Mr Atigala Widana Arachchilage Kasthurirathna described in the Schedule hereto should submit his/their claim to the undersigned in writing before 8th September, 2025 stating his/their right or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, exparte action will be taken to register title under Section 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act. No. 21 of 1998. P.C.D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Madura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 28th July, 2025.\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2450/09 - 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u0ddd\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dc3 18 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0db3\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.08.18\n\nNo. 2450/09 \u2013 MONDAY, AUGUST 18, 2025 - 18.08.2025\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 045168 - 04 (08/2025)\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc