    "chunk_text": "i. Establish specific committees at the district and divisional levels with specific members, specific terms of reference and time frame. Ensure representation from both the public and private sectors for these committees.\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'08'20Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 20.08.2025\n\n5A\n\niii. Enhance collaboration and inter-agency coordination among government institutions as well as across different levels of government (central/ provincial/ district and divisional).\n\n5. Expand Facilities for Attractive Destinations\n\ni. Develop and implement a comprehensive Visitor experience Model to implement our heritage hospitality management best practices, while enhancing entertainment, ensuring a seamless, engaging and safe experience for all visitors.\n\nii. Destination management and connectivity to ensure an attractive destination.\n\niii. Identify destinations, management and marketing strategies in collaboration with both the public and private sectors to enhance the competitiveness of tourism destinations while minimizing negative impacts and maximizing benefits.\n\niv. Expand basic infrastructure and develop destination-level facilities; encourage seamless connectivity for long-distance transportation; review major private sector investment projects; and promote sustainability across accommodation properties and the tourism supply chain.\n\nv. Develop tourism major city plans (Nuwara Eliya, Hikkaduwa, Negombo, Kalpitiya)\n\nvi. Implement the Marine Tourism Roadmap & Strategic Plan.\n\n6. Sustainable Tourism Development\n\ni. Implement signage and symbols in accordance with international standards in Sigiriya and other tourist destinations, and obtain international certification as standardized tourist sites.\n\n7. Tourism Promotion, Marketing and Branding"
