    "chunk_text": "AND, I do hereby require and direct the said Task Force to report to me all instances where any Government employee or an officer in any ministry, government department, state corporation or any such institution who delay the performance of duties and fulfilment of responsibilities or fail to perform such duties and responsibilities to be entrusted by the said Task Force.\n\nAND, I do hereby inform you, members of the Presidential Task Force, to submit reports to me from time to time, in respect of the execution of the aforesaid tasks by you.\n\nFURTHERMORE, I do hereby inform that the aforementioned Task Force shall complete the duties related to the aforesaid orders within a period of Two (02) years and submit the relevant report.\n\nGiven at Colombo under the Seal of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka on the 19th day of August, Two Thousand and Twenty Five. By order of the Honourable President,\n\nDr. N.S. Kumanayake, Secretary to the President.\n\nEOG 08-0222\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
